abstract: >-
  rotcert ports conformal prediction to oriented (rotated) object detection in
  aerial imagery: a seam-continuous, square-safe Gaussian-Wasserstein
  nonconformity score yields per-class localization certificates (G1) and a
  Learn-then-Test certified false-negative-rate bound with refusal semantics
  (G2), validated out-of-sample on DIOR-R, DOTA-v1.0, and HRSC2016-MS with
  frozen result records.
